{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"← [[GGYGO_架构总览.canvas|返回总览]]　·　文字说明见 [[计划蓝图]] 第 8 章\n\n# 表现层\n\n**事实澄清**：Lyra 没有专门的「GA 表现类」。\n`LyraGameplayCueManager` 只做资源异步/预加载优化，不含任何执行逻辑。\nGameplayCue 就是 GAS 的表现机制。","x":-320,"y":-380,"width":660,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ch-a","type":"text","text":"## 通道 A · Montage\n\n`AbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWait`（GAS 原生）\n\n**待移植**：`AbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent`\n播 Montage 的同时等 AnimNotify 事件。\nGAS 官方示例（ActionRPG）有，**Lyra 没有**。\n动作游戏必需 —— 判定窗口、可取消点都靠它。\n\n适用：有独立完整动画的动作（攻击、闪避、技能）\n联机：Montage 由 GAS 复制，本地预测播放","x":-100,"y":100,"width":580,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ch-b","type":"text","text":"## 通道 B · GameplayCue\n\nTag 触发 → `GameplayCueNotify_Static`（一次性）\n　　　　　/ `GameplayCueNotify_Actor`（持续）\n\n**待建**：`Cues/GGYGOGameplayCueManager`（照抄 Lyra 的\n异步加载优化）+ Burst / Looping 两个基类\n\n适用：特效、音效、屏幕震动、命中反馈\n联机：Cue 自带复制与本地预测","x":560,"y":100,"width":580,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ch-c","type":"text","text":"## 通道 C · AnimInstance 自拉 · 需改造\n\n**现状**：`Pipeline::PublishAnimation` →\n`UZZZAnimInstance::PipelineDrive(snapshot)`（推送模式）\n\n**D3 之后**：Pipeline 消失，改为 Lyra 的自拉模式\n`NativeUpdateAnimation` 里自己读：\n　CMC 的 Velocity / MovementMode / 步态 / TurnBack\n　ASC 的 `State.*` / `Restriction.*` Tag\n\n**快照结构与 Locomotion 决策/规则/事件算法全部保留**，\n只换上游数据源。\n\n适用：需要与移动混合的表现（受击姿态、上下半身分层）","x":-100,"y":480,"width":580,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"anim","type":"text","text":"## ZZZ 动画层 · 现有代码保留\n\n`Animation/zzzAnim/ZZZAnimInstance`\n`Animation/zzzAnim/Capture/ZZZAnimSnapshotCapture`\n`Animation/zzzAnim/Locomotion/`（Decisions / Events / Rules）\n`Animation/zzzAnim/Data/`（Context / Enums / Set /\n　Snapshot / StateMemory / Tuning）\n\n这是项目里投入最大、已调通手感的一块，\nD3 只改它的数据来源，不动内部算法。","x":560,"y":460,"width":580,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"attack-example","type":"text","text":"## 一次攻击用到全部三条通道\n\n`GA_Attack_Light` 激活后：\n\n**A** `PlayMontageAndWait`（in-place 攻击动画）\n**B** Montage 上的 AnimNotify 触发刀光 Cue\n**B** 命中时 GE 触发 `GameplayCue.Hit.*` → 命中特效、震屏\n**C** 给 ASC 加 `State.Attacking` → ZZZAnim 读到后切上半身层\n\n三条通道不是二选一，而是同一个动作的不同侧面。","x":-100,"y":900,"width":580,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"montage-conflict","type":"text","text":"## Montage 与 locomotion 的位移冲突\n\n攻击 Montage 若自带位移，而 locomotion 也在算位移，\n两者会叠加（CMC 累加 RootMotionSource）。\n\n解法见 [[GGYGO_模块_移动与位移.canvas|移动与位移子图]]：\n动画做成 in-place，位移交给 RootMotionSource，\n攻击期间用 `Restriction.CantMove` 停掉 locomotion 输入。","x":560,"y":840,"width":580,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"rule","type":"text","text":"## 表现层铁律\n\n**只读。**\n\nAnimBP、Cue、UI 只消费状态，\n不反向写权威数据。\n\n这条现有项目已经在守：\n`RuntimeData.ZZZAnim` 是单向投影。\nD3 之后数据源换了，但这条不变。","x":-920,"y":100,"width":540,"height":260,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e-rule-a","fromNode":"rule","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ch-a","toSide":"left","label":"约束全部通道"},
		{"id":"e-a-b","fromNode":"ch-a","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ch-b","toSide":"left","label":"Notify 触发 Cue"},
